{
  "$schema": "https://json-render.dev/schemas/tree.json",
  "version": "1.0",
  "root": {
    "type": "Container",
    "props": {
      "direction": "column",
      "gap": "lg"
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "content": "Perfect! I have everything I need to build your campaign, would you like to start the workflow?",
          "variant": "assistant"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": {
          "variant": "elevated",
          "className": "border-l-4 border-blue-500"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Text",
            "props": {
              "content": "Exclusive Rewards for Loyal Credit Card Users",
              "variant": "heading",
              "className": "font-bold text-xl"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "MetricGrid",
            "props": {
              "metrics": [
                { "label": "Case ID", "value": "CA-1145" },
                { "label": "Current Stage", "value": "Filling out provided detail" },
                { "label": "Progress", "value": "3 of 7" }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Stepper",
        "props": {
          "steps": [
            { "id": "creating-new-case", "label": "Creating new case", "status": "completed" },
            { "id": "analyzing-content", "label": "Analyzing content", "status": "completed" },
            { "id": "filling-out-detail", "label": "Filling out provided detail", "status": "current" },
            { "id": "attributes", "label": "Attributes", "status": "pending" },
            { "id": "availability", "label": "Availability", "status": "pending" },
            { "id": "engagement-policy", "label": "Engagement Policy", "status": "pending" },
            { "id": "channels", "label": "Channels", "status": "pending" }
          ],
          "currentStep": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "props": {
          "content": "## Attributes Details\n\nI've gotten as far as defining attributes and pre-filled the following details:\n\n- **Name**: Exclusive Rewards for Loyal Credit Card Users\n- **Description**: Reward loyal customers with exclusive offers on credit cards if they use their card twice a month.\n- **Product & Services**: U+ Bank Gold Credit Card\n- **Outcome**: Retain\n\nI need some additional information:\n\n- **Keycode**: (a unique identifier for tracking the campaign)\n- **Product ID**: (the identifier for this card product) In the past you have used \"A1455\"\n\nOnce we have those details, we can define the availability next."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "content": "Keycode is 1234, Product ID is A1455",
          "variant": "user",
          "className": "text-blue-600"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "content": "Great! Lets continue onto defining the rest of the campaign....",
          "variant": "assistant"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": {
          "variant": "info",
          "className": "border-l-4 border-blue-400"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "props": {
              "content": "We found another campaign called \"U+ Bank Credit Card\" has a similar engagement policy that has been approved by Legal and Compliance.\n\nThe differences are:\n\n- Age is greater than 24 instead of 25\n- Customer annual income is greater than or equal to 10,000 instead of 5,000\n\nReusing a pre-approved policy typically reduces build time by 5 days!\n\nWould you like to use the pre-approved policy?"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Container",
        "props": {
          "direction": "row",
          "gap": "sm"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Button",
            "props": {
              "label": "Yes, use the approved policy",
              "variant": "primary"
            },
            "actions": {
              "name": "submitForm",
              "params": { "choice": "approved" }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Button",
            "props": {
              "label": "No, use my own",
              "variant": "secondary"
            },
            "actions": {
              "name": "submitForm",
              "params": { "choice": "custom" }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
